    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/780e3a437b14cba587b09666c5d5966f.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JunkRats is an online co-op horror game featuring proximity voice chat and mutated monsters. Collect, Run, Extract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/077c355d8f0e1956c2c5c0bb894c4d71.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the Runners, they are a gang of JunkRats who have been tasked to make profits by selling valuable scrap from forbidden sectors within the wasteland city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/d64c19950d20b5acc6f4ea3fe8f5b470.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your next location and grab anything you can carry, just watch out for the virus! Make it out alive and you'll have some wads of cash to fill your pockets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/c8b07c86581b842266201d8f3becf63a.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work as a team with up to 4 player co-op! Salvage valuable assets together, revive downed team mates and survive the hell that awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/218e2aeb2bc997a36e819dc6c21e1a7c.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The virus was released into the world by accident and caused a worldwide pandemic. It mutated and disfigured anyone who was infected, turning people into gelatinous monsters. Let's hope you don't become one too. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/780e3a437b14cba587b09666c5d5966f.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JunkRats is an online co-op horror game featuring proximity voice chat and mutated monsters. Collect, Run, Extract.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/077c355d8f0e1956c2c5c0bb894c4d71.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the Runners, they are a gang of JunkRats who have been tasked to make profits by selling valuable scrap from forbidden sectors within the wasteland city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/d64c19950d20b5acc6f4ea3fe8f5b470.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your next location and grab anything you can carry, just watch out for the virus! Make it out alive and you'll have some wads of cash to fill your pockets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/c8b07c86581b842266201d8f3becf63a.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work as a team with up to 4 player co-op! Salvage valuable assets together, revive downed team mates and survive the hell that awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495770/extras/218e2aeb2bc997a36e819dc6c21e1a7c.avif?t=1754269284\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The virus was released into the world by accident and caused a worldwide pandemic. It mutated and disfigured anyone who was infected, turning people into gelatinous monsters. Let's hope you don't become one too. </p>",
